otors-ev-tiago-ev-pure-+-24-kwh\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Tata Motors EV\"}},{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Punch EV Smart 30 kWh\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-02-20-10-02-81-Untitled(1).png\",\"url\":\"https://evindia.online/product/tata-motors-ev-punch-ev-smart-30-kwh\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Tata Motors EV\"}},{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Tiago EV Creative\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-13-05-46-339-Photoroom.png\",\"url\":\"https://evindia.online/product/tata-motors-ev-tiago-ev-creative\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Tata Motors EV\"}},{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Punch New EV\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-03-12-13-03-78-Untitled(5).png\",\"url\":\"https://evindia.online/product/tata-motors-ev-punch-new-ev\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Tata Motors EV\"}},{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Tiago EV Pure + 19 kWh\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-05-28-12-05-96-338-Photoroom.png\",\"url\":\"https://evindia.online/product/tata-motors-ev-tiago-ev-pure-+\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Tata Motors EV\"}},{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Punch EV Smart Plus 30 kWh\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/2026-02-20-11-02-63-Untitled(5).png\",\"url\":\"https://evindia.online/product/tata-motors-ev-punch-ev-smart-plus-30-kwh\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Tata Motors EV\"}},{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Tiago XE (19.2 kWh)\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.evindia.online/uploads/vehicle_image/e3c1f6400dd92e1083c356ddb2413d8b\",\"url\":\"https://evindia.online/product/tata-motors-ev-tiago-xe-19.2-kwh\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Tata Motors EV\"}}],\n        \"model\": \"Tiago XT (19.2 kWh)\",\n        \"releaseDate\": \"2022-09-22\",\n        \"manufacturer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n          \"name\": \"Tata Motors EV\"\n        },\n        \"offers\": {\n           \"@type\": \"Offer\", \n           \"priceSpecification\": {\n              \"@type\": \"PriceSpecification\",\n              \"price\": \"929000\",\n              \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n            },\n           \"url\": \"https://evindia.online/product/tata-motors-ev-tiago-xt-19.2-kwh\",\n           \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/PreOrder\" \n        }\n        ,\n          \"aggregateRating\": {\n            \"@type\": \"AggregateRating\",\n            \"ratingValue\": \"4.2\",\n            \"bestRating\": \"5\",\n            \"worstRating\": \"1\",\n            \"ratingCount\": \"15\",\n            \"reviewCount\": \"15\"\n          },\n          \"review\": [{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Dhairya\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"For someone who needs all the basic car comforts (AC, music, and full power windows) in an electric package with good range, the XT MR is the best rational and economical choice from the entire Tiago EV lineup.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.5,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Harsh\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The lack of Keyless Entry/Push Button Start is a letdown. Having to manually insert the key in a modern electric car feels a bit dated. This feature is reserved for the much higher variants.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.9,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Abhay Gaikwad\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The power steering is light and responsive, making the car extremely maneuverable in heavy traffic. It is absolutely effortless to drive daily compared to any petrol automatic I have tried.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.4,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Anil\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"It is still only offered with 2 airbags (Driver/Passenger). While the platform is 4-star safety rated, competitors are starting to offer 6 airbags even in this price bracket. Needs an upgrade on passive safety.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.3,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Divya Pillai\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"I love the Folow Me Home Headlamps; a nice safety feature when parking late at night. The car is nimble (5.1m turning radius) and parking sensors make navigating tight lanes easy.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.8,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Sanjay Mehta\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The single biggest upgrade is the Power Windows for all four doors. The inconvenience of manually winding down the rear windows in the XE model was a major factor in choosing the XT.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.4,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Ritu Aggarwal\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"As a second car, the Tiago EV is brilliant. The 8-year/1,60,000 km battery warranty means zero long-term worries. It's the most secure EV investment in the affordable segment.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Kavita Joshi\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The cabin ambiance is much improved with the dual-tone interior and the functioning infotainment system. The 4-speaker sound system is clear enough for my daily commute and news updates.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.7,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Manish Kulkarni\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"I'm disappointed that this variant still doesn't include the rear wiper and washer, a vital feature for visibility during the monsoon season. Tata shouldn't have skipped basic safety features on this trim.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.9,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Neha Varma\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The charging time is efficient for daily use: under 7 hours on the 3.3 kW home charger, and the option for 25 kW DC fast charging (10-80% in 58 mins) is crucial for flexibility.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.8,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Gaurav Patidar\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The addition of Electrically Adjustable ORVMs and Body Coloured Door Handles over the base model gives the XT a much cleaner, premium look. It doesn't scream 'base model' like the XE.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.2,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Pooja Tandon\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"Tata including the Connected Car features (Remote AC On/Off via App) is a huge plus in our climate. I can cool the cabin before I step inside. It's a small luxury that makes a big difference.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.7,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Deepak Chopra\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The performance is excellent for city traffic. The 60 bhp motor provides instant acceleration (0-60 km/h in 6.2 seconds) and the 4 levels of regenerative braking are ideal for maximizing efficiency in stop-start traffic.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":5,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Aman Singhania\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"This variant hits the perfect spot for value. It keeps the 250 km claimed range (19.2 kWh) which is plenty for the city, but adds practical features like all four power windows and Steering-mounted controls.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":3.6,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Rajeshwari\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"The 7-inch touchscreen infotainment system is the game-changer here. Finally, I have Android Auto and Apple CarPlay! It makes a world of difference for navigation and music, justifying the price jump from the XE model.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.2,\"bestRating\":\"5\"}}]\n        \n      },\n      {\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n        \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n        \"itemListElement\": [\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 1,\n            \"name\": \"Home\",\n            \"item\": \"https://evindia.online/\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 2,\n            \"name\": \"Tata Motors EV\",\n            \"item\": \"https://evindia.online/electric-vehicle-companies/tata-motors-ev\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n            \"position\": 3,\n            \"name\": \"Tiago XT (19.2 kWh)\",\n            \"item\": \"https://evindia.online/product/tata-motors-ev-tiago-xt-19.2-kwh\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]","webPageSchema":"{\n      \"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\":\"WebPage\",\n      \"name\":\"Tata Tiago XT (19.2 kWh): Price, Range, Images, Features | EVINDIA\",\n      \"description\": \"Tata Tiago XT (19.2 kWh) pr